# Displacer Kitten: "exile up to one target nonland permanent you control, then return that card to the battlefield". A
# token that leaves the battlefield ceases to exist (CR 111.7, 704.5d), so it is not "that card" and does not come back:
# the Kitten's trigger on casting Mox Emerald (turn 3) exiles one of the two Spirit tokens of Lingering Souls and only one
# is left. The Kitten came down on turn 1 off a Black Lotus and a Mox Ruby; the Souls was paid with the other three Moxen
# (its own cast trigger was given no target).

